    "mobile_box_pc_btn": "",
    "mobile_box_pc_compat": "<strong>Compatibility:</strong> PWA standalone installation is natively supported by <strong>Google Chrome, Microsoft Edge, Brave, Opera</strong> and <strong>Safari</strong> (on Mac with macOS Sonoma or higher). On <strong>Firefox</strong> it is always usable instantly in the browser.",
    "mobile_box_pc_step1": "<strong style=\"color: var(--text-color, #0f172a);\">1. Open App in Browser:</strong> Click the button below <em>\"Open App in Browser\"</em>. The App will open in a new window/tab and automatically connect to your web session in 1 second, registering the computer (without codes or configuration).",
    "mobile_box_pc_step2": "<strong style=\"color: var(--text-color, #0f172a);\">2. Use the Install command:</strong> At the top of the screen a bar will appear with the <strong>\"Install Now\"</strong> button (or the monitor icon with an arrow in the address bar of Chrome / Edge).",
    "mobile_box_pc_step3": "<strong style=\"color: var(--text-color, #0f172a);\">3. Standalone application:</strong> By clicking <em>\"Install\"</em>, the browser will install the Web App as a dedicated desktop application (with its icon on the Desktop/Start menu), always launchable in full screen without browser bars.",
    "mobile_box_pc_sub": "Desktop and Laptop Computers",
    "mobile_box_pc_title": "",
    "mobile_box_phone_alt": "<strong>Alternatively from PC:</strong> if you are on a computer and want to connect your phone without logging in on mobile, generate a <strong>Pairing Serial</strong> using the button below and type it into the App on your phone.",
    "mobile_box_phone_btn": "",
    "mobile_box_phone_step1": "<strong style=\"color: var(--text-color, #0f172a);\">1. Log in from your phone:</strong> Open your mobile browser (Chrome on Android or Safari on iPhone), sign in to the NewFoobot website and go to this page (<em>Mobile App</em>).",
    "mobile_box_phone_step2": "<strong style=\"color: var(--text-color, #0f172a);\">2. Open the App:</strong> Tap the <strong>\"Open App on Smartphone\"</strong> button: the App will open connecting directly to your account and automatically registering the phone.",
    "mobile_box_phone_step3_android": "<strong>Android (Chrome)</strong>: tap <em>\"Install Now\"</em> in the top bar, or tap the menu (⋮) in the top right &rarr; <em>\"Install application\"</em>.",
    "mobile_box_phone_step3_ios": "<strong>iPhone / iPad (Safari)</strong>: tap the <strong>Share</strong> button (square icon with arrow pointing up) and select <em>\"Add to Home Screen\"</em>.",
    "mobile_box_phone_step3_title": "<strong style=\"color: var(--text-color, #0f172a);\">3. Add to Home Screen:</strong>",
    "mobile_box_phone_sub": "Android, iPhone and iPad",
