    "mobile_guide_step1_btn": "Open App on this browser &rarr;",
    "mobile_guide_step1_desc": "To use or install the App on this computer/device, first click the link below <strong>\"Open App on this browser\"</strong>. A new tab will open with the App, which connects automatically to your active session in 1 second (no codes needed) and the device will be automatically registered among your authorized devices. Once the App opens, click the <strong>\"Install Now\"</strong> button presented in the top header bar (or the download icon in your address bar) to install it as an application.",
